# GETTING INTO THE PLAN'S HALL QUIETLY (docs/interiors, 21_doors, FightSim
# suspicion): the warden stands its watch facing the bays with the hatch at its
# back. What it only half has -- a step heard, a glimpse behind its cone -- makes
# it unsure, and unsure long enough it turns to look; only what it sees in its
# cone makes it sure. So down the hatch crouched, and along to the bay it is not
# facing, is the way to a strongbox without being stood outside.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/hall-sneak.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the hall just come down into, crouched, the warden's back to the player.
# 02 is at a strongbox in the bay it does not face, still in the hall, unarrested.
coast calm
near door:weapons_hall
await door 5
hold crouch
press use 0.1
await inside:weapons_hall 5
wait 0.3
shot 01-down-the-hatch-crouched with inside:weapons_hall,mob:warden
walkto strongbox 14
wait 0.4
shot 02-at-a-strongbox-unarrested with inside:weapons_hall,box_near
